```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Content
  participant PW as Page World
  participant B as Background
  participant P as Popup
  C->>PW: inject probe (postMessage)
  PW-->>C: Shopify globals
  C->>B: SHOPIFY_RESULT_ACTION { result } (fire-and-forget)
  B->>B: cache per tab; set badge 'S'
  P->>B: GET_SHOPIFY_STATE_ACTION (cache-only)
  B-->>P: result or undefined
  alt manual check
    P->>B: GET_SHOPIFY_ACTION
    B->>PW: executeScript in MAIN world
    PW-->>B: detection result
    B-->>P: result
  end
```
